URL:https://www.rsobhd.net/events/ukadance-highland-day-of-dance/
SUMMARY:UKADance Highland Day of Dance
DESCRIPTION:We have a full day planned\, including the RSOBHD Judges’ Mee
 ting\, UKAdance Teachers’ Meeting\, lectures on the 2027 Championship an
 d SNDP Steps\, Youth &amp\; New Members’ Forum\, examination sessions an
 d student workshops.\n\nThe teachers' meeting will include CPD on the 2027
  Championship and SNDP steps. Prop 2 hours\n\nAt 3.25pm\, the RSOBHD Visio
 n Update &amp\; Discussion will also include a discussion around the pathw
 ay to the Judges’ Examination. This will be a useful opportunity for any
 one interested in understanding more about the route towards becoming an R
 SOBHD Judge.\n\nPlease see the programme\, HERE\, for the full timetable a
 nd details of the day.\n\nExam Sessions\nIf you would like to enter for on
 e of the examination sessions\, please complete the form below:\n\nExam Se
 ssions – Entry Form HERE\n\nStudent Workshops\nEntries for the student w
 orkshops can be made using the following form:\n\nWorkshop Entry Form HERE
 \n\nThe workshops will cover the 2027 Premiership and Championship Steps\,
  together with a Pre-Premier Highland &amp\; National session.
CATEGORIES:Judges CPD Lecture,Workshop
LOCATION:Cults Sports Complex\, Quarry Road\, Cults\, AB15 9TP\, United Kin
 gdom
GEO:57.1168572;-2.1913337999999385
